Subject: [PATCH] Show Screen recorder in the DeX panel

The DeX panel adds Screen recorder only when DeX reports standalone. It doesn't
here, so the tile never showed even though Screen recorder records DeX. Offer it
whenever the panel shows.

diff --git a/smali/f5/i.smali b/smali/f5/i.smali
index b2f737b..cc1c1ef 100644
--- a/smali/f5/i.smali
+++ b/smali/f5/i.smali
@@ -560,12 +560,8 @@
 
     if-eqz v4, :cond_1
 
-    invoke-static {v6}, Lp3/c;->e(Landroid/content/Context;)Z
-
-    move-result v4
-
-    if-eqz v4, :cond_1
-
+    # Onigiri: offer Screen recorder whenever the DeX panel shows. Samsung also requires DeX
+    # to report standalone, which it doesn't here (Airplane and Flashlight hide the same way).
     goto :goto_3
 
     :cond_7
